				"to": "00:00:23,300"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 20480,
				"to": 23300
			},
			"text": " And what proceeds turns out to be a lot of things."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:23,300",
				"to": "00:00:27,280"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 23300,
				"to": 27280
			},
			"text": " And they all happen very quickly, and it doesn't end well for the batter, or the pitcher."
